# Database Configuration
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/privacyguard"
PGHOST="localhost"
PGPORT="5432"
PGUSER="your_username"
PGPASSWORD="your_password"
PGDATABASE="privacyguard"

# Authentication
SESSION_SECRET="your-super-secret-session-key-here"
REPL_ID="your-replit-app-id"
REPLIT_DOMAINS="localhost:5000,your-domain.replit.app"
ISSUER_URL="https://replit.com/oidc"

# Node Environment
NODE_ENV="development"